# Navigation & shell

- **Rail** (left, dark chrome): brand (monogram + wordmark) on top, one flat
  destination list (icon + label), settings pinned at bottom. Active item =
  higher opacity + slanted accent bar at the system angle.
- **Header** (light): competition identity (crest, name, status pill, dates)
  + the À traiter bell with numeric badge. No breadcrumbs, no duplicated brand.
- The rail is the only dark surface and the only place the wordmark appears
  inside the app.
- Navigation is context-first: the competition is the workspace; global brand
  presence stays minimal outside Home.
- Nav icons: one per destination, from `design-system/icons/shellIcons.tsx`.
